            analogous in many ways to a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flag+variety"} flag variety
            of complex semsimple Lie groups
          %p
            As a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/symplectic+manifold"} symplectic manifold
            it can be realized as
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
